  I18N.dict.en["app.913"] = "Edit mode: you can modify the header and line items and preview differences in real time; saving calls the backend PUT (payment term changes auto-write back to the supplier's last-used item). \"PI No. / Related PO / Supplier / PI date / Currency\" are locked and cannot be changed."; I18N.dict.id["app.913"] = "Mode edit: Anda dapat mengubah header dan item serta melihat pratinjau selisih secara real-time; menyimpan memanggil PUT backend (perubahan syarat pembayaran otomatis ditulis kembali ke item terakhir supplier). \"No. PI / PO terkait / Supplier / Tanggal PI / Mata uang\" dikunci dan tidak dapat diubah.";
