  I18N.dict.en["html.renderUsers"] = "<div id=\"flash-container\"></div><div class=\"table-section\"><div class=\"table-section-title\"><div class=\"table-section-title-left\">👤 User Management</div></div><div class=\"table-container\"><table class=\"data-table\"><thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Username</th><th>Feishu ID(Masked)</th><th>Email</th><th>Source</th><th>Status</th><th>Role</th><th>Language Preference</th><th>Data Scope</th><th>Actions</th></tr></thead><tbody>{v1}</tbody></table></div><div class=\"pc-hint\">Users are auto-created on first Feishu login (default <b>Pending</b>, no role, no permission). After the admin enables and assigns a role, the user may access the system. Creating local password accounts is not allowed, changing passwords is not allowed, editing the Feishu ID is not allowed, disabling/ or deleting emergency accounts.</div></div>"; I18N.dict.id["html.renderUsers"] = "<div id=\"flash-container\"></div><div class=\"table-section\"><div class=\"table-section-title\"><div class=\"table-section-title-left\">👤 Manajemen Pengguna</div></div><div class=\"table-container\"><table class=\"data-table\"><thead><tr><th>Nama</th><th>Nama Pengguna</th><th>ID Feishu(Disamarkan)</th><th>Email</th><th>Sumber</th><th>Status</th><th>Peran</th><th>Preferensi Bahasa</th><th>Cakupan Data</th><th>Aksi</th></tr></thead><tbody>{v1}</tbody></table></div><div class=\"pc-hint\">Pengguna dibuat otomatis saat login Feishu pertama (default <b>Tertunda</b>, tanpa peran, tanpa izin). Setelah admin mengaktifkan dan menetapkan peran, pengguna dapat mengakses sistem. Membuat akun kata sandi lokal tidak diizinkan, mengubah kata sandi tidak diizinkan, mengedit ID Feishu tidak diizinkan, menonaktifkan/ atau menghapus akun darurat.</div></div>";
